						<span class='details-icon bp5-icon bp5-icon-calendar'></span>
						<span class='details-title'>Approved On:</span>
					</span>
					<span class='details-value'>${formatDate(entry?.decided_on)}</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<br>`;
	})
	.join("")
	}
}

/* helpers */
const toBool = (v) => {
  if (typeof v === 'boolean') return v;
  if (typeof v === 'number') return v !== 0;
  if (typeof v === 'string') return ['1','true','yes','y'].includes(v.trim().toLowerCase());
  return false;
};
const isCaLawsuitMatter = (properties, propertyMap, ridMap) => {
  const notice = getPropertyValue(properties, "ca_civil_penalty_notice_flag", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const lawsuit = getPropertyValue(properties, "ca_lawsuit_flag", propertyMap, ridMap);
  return toBool(notice) && toBool(lawsuit);
};

/* ---- Role helpers ---- */
/* External CA-lawsuit “allowed to see actions at all” roles (DC excluded) */
const ALLOWED_ACTION_ROLES = new Set(["Defending Firm", "Early Starter Firm", "Statutory Notice Firm"]);
const hasActionRoleForFirm = (props, firmId) => {
  const roles = (props.assignmentDetails?.byFirm?.[firmId]?.roles || []).map(r => r.assignmentType);
  return roles.some(r => ALLOWED_ACTION_ROLES.has(r));
};

const matterTableActions = (
  properties,
  propertyMap,
  ridMap,
  isUserFromExternalLawFirm,
  currentUserFirmId,
  isLegalAssistantOrClerk,
  hasReadOnlyRole
) => {
  if (hasReadOnlyRole) return '';

  const caLawsuit = isCaLawsuitMatter(properties, propertyMap, ridMap);
  const rolesForCurrentFirm = (properties.assignmentDetails?.byFirm?.[currentUserFirmId]?.roles || []).map(r => r.assignmentType);
  const isUserFirmAssignedWithActionRole = rolesForCurrentFirm.some(r => ALLOWED_ACTION_ROLES.has(r));

  /* External CA-lawsuit without DF/ESF/SNF ⇒ no actions */
  if (isUserFromExternalLawFirm && caLawsuit && !isUserFirmAssignedWithActionRole) return '';

  const status = getPropertyValue(properties, "assignment_status", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const name = getPropertyValue(properties, "name", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const id = getPropertyValue(properties, "id", propertyMap, ridMap);

  /* Role flags for external firms */
  const isDF  = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Defending Firm");
  const isESF = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Early Starter Firm");
  const isSNF = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Statutory Notice Firm");
  const isDC  = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Discovery Counsel");

  const hasESFAssigned = properties.assignmentDetails?.byType?.["Early Starter Firm"]?.length > 0;
  const hasCaseEvaluation = !!properties.caseEvaluationDetails?.caseEvaluationId;
  const hasReleasedEvaluation =
    !!getPropertyValue(properties, "evaluation_released_at", propertyMap, ridMap) &&
    !!getPropertyValue(properties, "evaluation_released_by", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const hasSummaryDisposition = !!getPropertyValue(properties, "final_disposition_completed_at", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const hasMatterDisposition = !!getPropertyValue(properties, "matter_disposition_updated_at", propertyMap, ridMap);

  const markSettledButton = hasSummaryDisposition
    ? cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-tick-circle bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="settleMatter" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Mark as Settled"
      )
    : `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-tick-circle bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary deactivate-action-button" role="button" title="Please complete the disposition summary before settling the case."></a>`;
  const markClosedButton = hasSummaryDisposition && hasMatterDisposition
    ? cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-lock bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="closeMatter" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Mark as Closed"
      )
    : `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-lock bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary deactivate-action-button" role="button" title="Please complete both the disposition summary and the matter disposition before closing the matter."></a>`;

  let actions = "";

  /* Unassigned: Internal (LA/Clerk) → Add Assignment */
  if (status === "Unassigned") {
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm && isLegalAssistantOrClerk) {
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-add bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="editAssignment" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Add Assignment"
      )}`;
    }
  }

  /* Open */
  if (status === "Open") {
    /* Internal → Settle, Close, Log, Update, Re-assign */
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm) {
      actions += `${markSettledButton}`;
      actions += `${markClosedButton}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-application bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addFinalDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Log Disposition Summary"
      )}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-saved bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="updateMatterDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Update Matter Disposition"
      )}`;
      // COMMENTED OUT: Log Settlement Negotiation button
      // actions += `${cardTooltip(`<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-many-to-many bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addSettlementNegotiation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`, "Log Settlement Negotiation")}`
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-exchange bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="reAssignment" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Re-assign"
      )}`;
    }

    /* DF → Case Eval (+Primary Assignee). ESF → Case Eval. SNF/DC → none */
    if (!hasCaseEvaluation && isUserFromExternalLawFirm && (
      (!hasReleasedEvaluation && isESF) ||
      ((!hasESFAssigned || hasReleasedEvaluation) && isDF)
    )) {
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-form bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary dontshow" slClickEvent="draftCaseEvaluation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Add Case Evaluation"
      )}`;
    }
    if (isUserFromExternalLawFirm && isDF) {
      const assignmentId = (properties.assignmentDetails?.byFirm?.[currentUserFirmId]?.roles || [])
        .filter(role => role.assignmentType === "Defending Firm")?.[0]?.assignmentId ?? '';
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-person bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addPrimaryAssignee" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}||${assignmentId}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Add Primary Assignee"
      )}`;
    }
    if (isUserFromExternalLawFirm && isESF) {
      // COMMENTED OUT: Log Settlement Negotiation button
      // actions += `${cardTooltip(`<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-many-to-many bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addSettlementNegotiation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`, "Log Settlement Negotiation")}`
    }
  }

  /* In Progress */
  if (status === "In Progress") {
    /* ESF/DF → Case Eval (DF only if no ESF or ESF released) */
    if (!hasCaseEvaluation && isUserFromExternalLawFirm && (
      (!hasReleasedEvaluation && isESF) ||
      ((!hasESFAssigned || hasReleasedEvaluation) && isDF)
    )) {
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-form bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary dontshow" slClickEvent="draftCaseEvaluation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Add Case Evaluation"
      )}`;
    }

    /* Internal or DF → Settle*, Close*, Log, Update */
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm || isDF) {
      actions += `${markSettledButton}`;
      actions += `${markClosedButton}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-application bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addFinalDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Log Disposition Summary"
      )}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-saved bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="updateMatterDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Update Matter Disposition"
      )}`;
    }

    /* COMMENTED OUT: Settlement Negotiation */
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm || isDF || isESF) {
      // actions += `${cardTooltip(`<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-many-to-many bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addSettlementNegotiation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`, "Log Settlement Negotiation")}`
    }

    /* Re-assign → Internal only */
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm) {
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-exchange bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="reAssignment" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Re-assign"
      )}`;
    }
  }

  /* Settled */
  if (status === "Settled") {
    /* Internal or DF → Close*, Log, Update. ESF/SNF/DC → none */
    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm || isDF) {
      actions += `${markClosedButton}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-application bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addFinalDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Log Disposition Summary"
      )}`;
      actions += `${cardTooltip(
        `<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-saved bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="updateMatterDisposition" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`,
        "Update Matter Disposition"
      )}`;
    }

    if (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm || isESF) {
      // COMMENTED OUT: Log Settlement Negotiation button
      // actions += `${cardTooltip(`<a class="bp5-button bp5-icon-many-to-many bp5-minimal bp5-intent-primary" slClickEvent="addSettlementNegotiation" slClickEventValue="${name}||${id}" tabindex="0" role="button"></a>`, "Log Settlement Negotiation")}`
    }
  }

  return `${
    actions
      ? `<div class="actions">
          <div class="bp5-button-group">
            ${actions}
          </div>
        </div>`
      : ''
  }`;
};

const nameColumn = (
  properties,
  propertyMap,
  ridMap,
  isUserFromExternalLawFirm,
  currentUserFirmId,
  isLegalAssistantOrClerk,
  hasReadOnlyRole
) => {
  const name = getPropertyValue(properties, "name", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const id = getPropertyValue(properties, "id", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const caseHandlerId = getPropertyValue(properties, "case_handler", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const caseHandlerIndex = caseHandlerId ? properties.caseHandlerDetails.raw.indexOf(caseHandlerId) : null;
  const caseHandlerName = caseHandlerId ? properties.caseHandlerDetails.display[caseHandlerIndex] : '-';
  const lastModifiedById = getPropertyValue(properties, "last_modified_by", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const lastModifiedByIndex = lastModifiedById ? properties.lastModifiedByDetails.raw.indexOf(lastModifiedById) : null;
  const lastModifiedByName = lastModifiedById ? properties.lastModifiedByDetails.display[lastModifiedByIndex] : null;
  const legalAssistantId = getPropertyValue(properties, "legal_assistant", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const legalAssistantIndex = legalAssistantId ? properties.legalAssistantDetails.raw.indexOf(legalAssistantId) : null;
  const legalAssistantName = legalAssistantId ? (properties.legalAssistantDetails.display[legalAssistantIndex] ?? '-') : '-';
  const serveDate = getPropertyValue(properties, "serve_notice_date", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const trialDate = getPropertyValue(properties, "trial_date", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const assignedAt = getPropertyValue(properties, "assigned_at", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const assignDate = assignedAt ? moment(assignedAt).format('MMM Do, YYYY') : '-';
  const venueName = getPropertyValue(properties, "venue_name", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const venueState = getPropertyValue(properties, "venue_state", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const venueStateValue = venueState ? `(${venueState})` : null;
  const venue = [venueName, venueStateValue].filter(Boolean).join(' ') || "-";
  const lastModified = getPropertyValue(properties, "last_modified", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const lastModifiedDate = moment(lastModified);
  const today = moment();
  const lastUpdated = moment.duration(today.diff(lastModifiedDate)).humanize();
  const caseProgressUpdatedAt = getPropertyValue(properties, "case_progress_updated_at", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const readableCaseProgressUpdatedAt = caseProgressUpdatedAt ? moment.duration(today.diff(moment(caseProgressUpdatedAt))).humanize() : "";
  const caseProgressUpdatedId = getPropertyValue(properties, "case_progress_updated_by", propertyMap, ridMap) ?? null;
  const caseProgressUpdatedIndex = caseProgressUpdatedId ? properties.lastModifiedByDetails.raw.indexOf(caseProgressUpdatedId) : null;
  const caseProgressUpdatedByName = caseProgressUpdatedIndex ? properties.lastModifiedByDetails.display[caseProgressUpdatedIndex] : null;
  const openDate = getPropertyValue(properties, "serve_notice_date", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const caseAge = dateDifference(openDate);

  /* External role flags for rendering decision */
  const rolesForCurrentFirm = (properties.assignmentDetails?.byFirm?.[currentUserFirmId]?.roles || []).map(r => r.assignmentType);
  const isDF  = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Defending Firm");
  const isESF = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Early Starter Firm");
  const isSNF = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Statutory Notice Firm");
  const isDC  = rolesForCurrentFirm.includes("Discovery Counsel");

  const caseEvalReleased = !!getPropertyValue(properties, "evaluation_released_at", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const hasSummaryDisposition = !!getPropertyValue(properties, "final_disposition_completed_at", propertyMap, ridMap);
  const hasMatterDisposition = !!getPropertyValue(properties, "matter_disposition", propertyMap, ridMap);

  const matterTags = [];
  if (hasSummaryDisposition) matterTags.push("Disposition Summary");
  if (hasMatterDisposition) matterTags.push("Matter Disposition");
  const formattedMatterTags = matterTags.length
    ? `<div class="matter-tags">${matterTags.map(tag => `<span class="matter-tag-display">${tag}</span>`).join('<span class="bp5-text-muted"> | </span>')}</div>`
    : '';

  const isUserFirmAssignedWithActionRole = hasActionRoleForFirm(properties, currentUserFirmId);
  const effectiveReadOnly =
    hasReadOnlyRole ||
    (isUserFromExternalLawFirm && isCaLawsuitMatter(properties, propertyMap, ridMap) && !isUserFirmAssignedWithActionRole);

  /* Only Internal, DF, ESF ever see action buttons at all (SNF/DC → none) */
  const shouldShowActions = !effectiveReadOnly && (!isUserFromExternalLawFirm || isDF || isESF);

  return `<div class="column name-column actions-column">
            <h6 class='bp5-heading matter-name'>
                <span slClickEvent="openMatter" slClickEventValue="${id}">${id} - ${name}</span>
            </h6>
            <div class="matter-age"><small>${caseAge} <span class="matter-update bp5-text-muted">${readableCaseProgressUpdatedAt ? '&nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;Advanced ' : ''}${caseProgressUpdatedByName ? `by ${caseProgressUpdatedByName}</span>` : ''} ${readableCaseProgressUpdatedAt ? `<span class="matter-update  bp5-text-muted"> ${readableCaseProgressUpdatedAt} ago</span>` : ''}</small> </div>
            <div class="details-card">
                <div class="details-column">
                    <div class="matter-property" title="${legalAssistantName}"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Legal Assistant: </span> ${legalAssistantName}</div>
                    <div class="matter-property"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Serve Date: </span> ${formatDate(serveDate)}</div>
                    <div class="matter-property" title="${venue}"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Venue (State): </span> ${venue}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="details-column">
                    <div class="matter-property" title="${caseHandlerName}"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Case Handler:</span> ${caseHandlerName ?? '-'}</div>
                    <div class="matter-property"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Trial Date: </span> ${formatDate(trialDate)}</div>
                    <div class="matter-property"><span class="bp5-text-muted">Assign Date: </span> ${assignDate ? assignDate : '-'}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            ${formattedMatterTags}
            <div class="matter-footer-line">
                <div class="matter-released">${caseEvalReleased ? `<span>Released</span>` : ''}</div>
                <div class="matter-last-updated"><small class="matter-update bp5-text-muted">${lastModifiedByName || lastModified ? 'Modified ' : ''}${lastModifiedByName ? `by ${lastModifiedByName}` : ''} ${lastModified ? ` ${lastUpdated} ago` : ''}</small></div>
            </div>
            ${shouldShowActions
              ? matterTableActions(properties, propertyMap, ridMap, isUserFromExternalLawFirm, currentUserFirmId, isLegalAssistantOrClerk, effectiveReadOnly)
              : ''}
        </div>`;
};

